od":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:5e8a2cfc6ff85cd8b86eab800949b123b3a28bfdf9a71193c6001621939a01c5","file":"preprints/Finite-cylinder-approximation-of-ruled-sets-September-27-2026/build/sections/product-methods.tex","line":256,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"f3835b415e4e067a42c7b09066da8ee26ee186874a3520d410dfbd94d2d47870","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Finite-cylinder-approximation-of-ruled-sets-September-27-2026/build/sections/product-methods.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:5e8a2cfc6ff85cd8b86eab800949b123b3a28bfdf9a71193c6001621939a01c5","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Finite-cylinder-approximation-of-ruled-sets-September-27-2026/build/sections/product-methods.tex#L256"},"statement_kind":"corollary","text":"\\label{b:logarithmic}\nLet $X,k>0$, let $U\\subset\\mathbb R^2$ be compact with\n$|\\partial U|=0$, and let $v$ be $C^2$ on an open rectangle containing\n$U$.  Suppose that, for every $p\\in U$,\n\\[\n \\operatorname{tr}Dv(p)=0,\\qquad \\det Dv(p)<0,\\qquad\n kX\\sqrt{-\\det Dv(p)}<1.\n\\]\nIn orthonormal coordinates $(x,p)\\in\\mathbb R\\times\\mathbb R^2$,\nthe set\n\\[\n \\{(x,p+xkv(p)):p\\in U,\\ |x|\\le X\\}\n\\]\nhas, for every $e>0$, a finite cylinder cover with bounded open\nmeasurable perpendicular bases and total base area at most\n\\[\n \\int_U(1+k^2|v(p)|^2)^{-1/2}\\,dp+e.\n\\]"}
